            <abstract>The New Jersey Department of Transportation (NJDOT) 2023 Straight Line Diagrams (SLDs) are a way to view roadways in a line format. The SLD network presents approximately 12,528 miles of State (Interstate, US and NJ numbered roads), National Highway System (NHS), Surface Transportation Program (STP) and all County routes.</abstract>
